WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.849 --> 00:00:05.100
At the start of Game of Thrones, Arya Stark
is a rebellious tomboy.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:11.320
She doesn’t want to be a noble lady like
society expects of her – she wants adventure

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.380
and freedom.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:17.610
Arya loves her brother Jon – he understands
what it’s like to not fit in.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.590
Jon gives Arya a sword called Needle.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:25.830
Arya sees that the world is unfair – because
of Cersei’s cruelty and Joffrey’s lies,

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:30.850
Arya loses her wolf Nymeria, and her friend
Mycah is killed.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:37.329
So Arya starts to hate her enemies . Syrio
Forel teaches Arya to fight – and says the

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:44.089
only god is death . When war begins with the
Lannisters, Arya has to leave Syrio for dead.

00:00:44.089 --> 00:00:50.210
And when a stableboy grabs Arya, she stabs
him – Arya’s first kill is this poor dumb

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:51.210
kid.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:56.569
Arya lives rough in King’s Landing for a
while, then sees the execution of her father

00:00:56.569 --> 00:00:57.589
Ned.

00:00:57.589 --> 00:01:03.260
Yoren takes her north, and for her safety,
Arya pretends to be a boy called Arry . So

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:09.700
in Season 1, Arya is separated from her family
and her identity, and moves towards violence

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.479
and death.

00:01:11.479 --> 00:01:17.180
In Season 2, Arya makes friends with Gendry,
and Lommy and Hot Pie, but she struggles with

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:20.480
trauma from the loss and death she’s seen.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:26.619
Her way of coping is to repeat a list of the
people she wants to kill . Yoren’s group

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:32.880
is attacked by Lannisters – a soldier called
Polliver kills Lommy and takes Needle . Arya’s

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:39.110
imprisoned at Harrenhal – where she suffers,
and sees innocent people tortured and killed.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:45.060
She’s made to serve Tywin Lannister , the
man who’s waging a war against her family.

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:49.750
So Arya has to hide her identity, and use
her wits to survive.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:56.679
A Faceless Man called Jaqen H’ghar kills
people for Arya , giving her a taste of power

00:01:56.679 --> 00:01:58.299
and vengeance.

00:01:58.299 --> 00:02:02.219
With Jaqen’s help, Arya Gendry and Hot Pie
escape Harrenhal.

00:02:02.219 --> 00:02:08.530
Jaqen offers to train Arya in Braavos , but
she wants to stay and find her family . Jaqen

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:14.930
leaves Arya with a coin, and the words “Valar
Morghulis” – all men must die.

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:21.610
So Harrenhal hardens Arya, teaching her to
use violence and cunning to survive.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:27.130
In Season 3, Arya Gendry and Hot Pie are captured
by the Brotherhood Without Banners.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:32.300
The Brotherhood also captures the Hound, and
Arya wants him dead, because the Hound killed

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.300
Mycah.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:39.300
But the Hound wins his trial and goes free
– so again Arya finds no justice in the

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.300
world.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:45.880
Arya wants a “family” of people she can
rely on, but Hot Pie and Gendry both leave

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:49.180
her, so Arya feels abandoned and alone.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:53.330
Arya learns to use a bow better, which might
come in handy.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:58.310
And Melisandre visits, saying that she’ll
meet Arya again . But then the Brotherhood

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.690
betrays Gendry, and they fail to take Arya
home.

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:06.290
So Arya gets sick of their bullshit and runs
away – but then she’s captured by the

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.290
Hound.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:12.060
The Hound takes Arya to the Twins, and for
a moment, Arya dares to hope that she’ll

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:17.510
see her family again – but they arrive in
time for the Red Wedding, where Arya’s mother

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:20.270
and brother are murdered.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:24.760
Arya’s hopes are crushed again, and all
she can do is kill some Freys in vengeance

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:31.400
– she uses Jaqen’s coin and says “Valar
Morghulis” . So in Season 3, Arya learns

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:37.320
that she can’t rely on anyone – friends
will just leave her, family will die, and

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:42.820
there’s no justice, unless she kills her
enemies herself .

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:48.480
In Season 4, Arya journeys through the war-torn
riverlands with the Hound, who leads her deeper

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.300
into violence and cynicism.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:56.940
They fight some Lannisters, and Arya kills
Polliver – the first name off her list.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:01.370
She avenges Lommy, retrieves Needle, and gets
her own horse to ride.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:06.170
This is like the first good thing that happens
to Arya in three seasons, and she achieves

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.030
it by killing.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:12.410
When a kind farmer offers them food and a
job, the Hound mugs the farmer.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:17.130
Arya is furious, but the Hound teaches that
this just “the way things are” – the

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:23.290
weak die, and the strong survive . He says
hate is a good motivation to keep someone

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:29.390
going . On one level, Arya hates the Hound
for being so brutal and callous . But the

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:33.160
Hound is also the only person who understands
Arya.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:39.320
The Hound feels betrayed by his family, abandoned
and alone , with only hate and violence to

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:45.540
hide his hurt – and that’s just how Arya
feels . So Arya and the Hound care for each

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:49.080
other when no one else does.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:54.150
Arya meets Brienne, and she likes her – identifies
with another misfit female warrior.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:59.470
But the Hound gets suspicious, and they end
up fighting – leaving the Hound near death.

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:03.440
The Hound asks Arya to mercy kill him , but
Arya refuses.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.950
She tells herself that she wants the Hound
to suffer.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:12.210
But deep down, Arya just doesn’t want to
kill her only friend . With most of her family

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:18.260
dead, and with nowhere to go , Arya uses Jaqen’s
coin to sail to Braavos.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:21.960
Maybe here she can find peace, happiness and
family.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.150
But nope, she joins a death cult.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:31.210
In Season 5, Arya joins the Faceless Men – a
cult of assassins who worship death . To truly

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:37.389
join them, Arya must become “No one” – to
give up her identity, all her hopes, loves

00:05:37.389 --> 00:05:38.440
and hates.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:44.750
So Arya throws away the things that make her
Arya, except she secretly keeps Needle.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:51.630
This sword represents her family, Winterfell,
Jon – so deep down, Arya remains a Stark.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:56.590
Arya works in the House of Black and White
– she sweeps, cleans corpses, and gives

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.760
the gift of death to a suffering child.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:04.920
She contends with the waif, a rival Faceless
Man who doesn’t believe that Arya is no

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:10.260
one . Arya takes on the identity of Lanna
, and spies around Braavos.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:15.200
Jaqen orders her to kill her first target,
the “thin man” . But instead, Arya goes

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:19.090
after Meryn Trant, the Kingsguard who killed
Syrio.

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:25.000
She follows Meryn to a brothel, uses a Faceless
disguise, and brutally kills him – another

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.020
name off her list.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:31.100
But the Faceless are mad, because Arya not
only killed the wrong person, but she did

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.800
it for her personal revenge.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:39.620
When the Faceless Men are meant to be no one,
giving death anonymously as a religious gift.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:45.660
So the man who Arya thinks is Jaqen kills
himself, but then another Man wears Jaqen’s

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:46.660
face.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:52.010
Because there is no Jaqen, he’s just a false
identity worn by the Faceless Men.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:58.470
So in the most confusing way possible, Arya
loses another “friend” . And because Arya

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:07.060
wore a face before she was allowed, Arya is
made blind . Season 5 plunges Arya into darkness.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:11.250
In Season 6, Arya lives as a blind beggar
in Braavos.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:15.690
The waif beats her with a stick, teaching
her to fight blind – and trying to break

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:21.150
her psychologically, to make her admit she’s
not no one . But Arya persists.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:25.590
She gets a training montage, and fights with
sticks, until she can finally hold off the

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.840
waif, and Jaqen gives her sight back.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:34.530
Jaqen orders Arya to kill an actress called
Lady Crane, and warns this is Arya’s last

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.520
chance to join the Faceless.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:43.580
Arya watches Crane act in a play about Westeros
– and relives the execution of her father.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:48.419
But she’s also moved by Cersei’s grief,
as played by Lady Crane.

00:07:48.419 --> 00:07:52.220
Arya likes Crane, so she refuses to kill her.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:57.740
Which means she’s used up her last chance
with the Faceless Men . Arya takes back Needle,

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.979
gets a haircut, and books a ship home.

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:03.400
But then she’s attacked by the waif, and
almost dies.

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:08.750
She’s saved by Lady Crane – Arya’s mercy
saves her own life.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:14.139
For the first time in a long time, Arya rests
and feels safe with a friend who cares for

00:08:14.139 --> 00:08:18.970
her, but then the waif kills Crane – another
dead friend.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:24.140
Arya lures the waif to a dark room, and uses
her blind training to kill her.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:29.699
She confronts Jaqen, and says she’s not
no one – she’s Arya Stark of Winterfell,

00:08:29.699 --> 00:08:35.959
and she’s going home . So in Season 6, Arya
learns the Faceless skills of deception and

00:08:35.959 --> 00:08:42.080
disguise, but she also returns to her identity
as Arya, and she goes back to Westeros.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:46.399
Arya kills Walder Frey, and bakes his sons
into a pie.

00:08:46.399 --> 00:08:51.959
And in Season 7, Arya disguises herself with
Walder’s face, and poisons a room full of

00:08:51.959 --> 00:08:57.949
Freys – finally avenging the Red Wedding
. But then she meets some Lannister soldiers,

00:08:57.949 --> 00:09:03.110
and learns that not all of her enemies are
evil – some of them are Ed Sheeran.

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:07.240
Arya meets her old friend Hot Pie, and they
don’t quite reconnect.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:13.790
Arya’s unable to describe what she’s been
through . Her experiences have changed her.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:18.529
She runs into her direwolf Nymeria, and asks
the wolf to come with her, but she doesn’t

00:09:18.529 --> 00:09:24.319
. Cause Nymeria has changed, become wild and
independent – she isn’t the pet she was

00:09:24.319 --> 00:09:28.019
before, just like Arya isn’t the girl she
was before.

00:09:28.019 --> 00:09:32.139
Arya returns to Winterfell, and it’s changed
too.

00:09:32.139 --> 00:09:37.439
Sansa has become Lady Stark , in charge of
the castle, and Bran has become a psychic

00:09:37.439 --> 00:09:38.439
weirdo.

00:09:38.439 --> 00:09:42.120
Arya gets a Valyrian steel dagger, and makes
friends with Brienne.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:49.070
But Sansa is disturbed that her sister is
now a killer . And Arya accuses Sansa of undermining

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:51.810
Jon for her own political power.

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:57.640
All the sisters’ childhood resentments return,
and Littlefinger works to divide them further

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:03.149
– it gets to the point where Arya threatens
to kill Sansa . But in the finale, the sisters

00:10:03.149 --> 00:10:07.069
finally unite, and bring Littlefinger to justice.

00:10:07.069 --> 00:10:12.850
They learn to respect one another, and bond
over their Stark identities . So in Season

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:18.420
7, we see how the experiences that made Arya
a powerful killer have also alienated her

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.390
from her friends and family.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:25.829
If she continues her path of vengeance, will
Arya lose her humanity?

00:10:25.829 --> 00:10:30.089
What’ll happen to Arya in the final season
of Thrones?

00:10:30.089 --> 00:10:35.949
There’ll be more reunions – Arya will
finally see Jon again . She’ll likely reunite

00:10:35.949 --> 00:10:41.440
with Gendry, and there could be a romance
there – Gendry likes to call Arya “my

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:46.519
lady” . Arya will meet Daenerys, and she’ll
probably like her – Arya has said that she

00:10:46.519 --> 00:10:50.899
admires dragon queens , maybe she’ll get
a dragon ride.

00:10:50.899 --> 00:10:56.389
Reunions with the Hound and Melisandre and
Beric will be complicated, cause they were

00:10:56.389 --> 00:11:01.069
all on Arya’s death list for a while . Will
Arya still hold these grudges?

00:11:01.069 --> 00:11:03.559
There might not be time for that drama.

00:11:03.559 --> 00:11:09.649
Cause in the Season 8 trailer, the dead attack
Winterfell, and Arya fights for the living.

00:11:09.649 --> 00:11:15.009
With her Valyrian dagger, and obsidian weapons,
she might kill a white walker or two.

00:11:15.009 --> 00:11:20.779
Maybe her ultimate test as an assassin could
be trying to kill the Night King . Bran gave

00:11:20.779 --> 00:11:22.930
her that dagger for a reason.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:28.029
But Arya will wanna finish her death list,
and the last two names are the Mountain and

00:11:28.029 --> 00:11:33.249
Queen Cersei . The Hound once said that he
and Arya could kill the Mountain together

00:11:33.249 --> 00:11:38.629
. Maybe the Hound will be wounded in this
fight, and Arya will finally have to mercy-kill

00:11:38.629 --> 00:11:42.100
her friend . But will Arya kill Cersei?

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:46.139
Arya was sympathetic when she saw Cersei played
by Lady Crane.

00:11:46.139 --> 00:11:52.540
Arya relates to Cersei’s feelings of grief
and anger . So maybe Arya will show Cersei

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:58.350
mercy, just like she spared Crane . Arya’s
actress, Maisie Williams, said she hopes Arya

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:04.970
will let go of anger and revenge, to find
peace and happiness . Maybe Arya can finally

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:07.339
get the family she’s always wanted.

00:12:07.339 --> 00:12:12.350
Like, she wouldn’t marry a lord and have
fifteen kids – that’s not her.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:18.929
But maybe she could have home at Winterfell
as queensguard for Sansa, or for Jon or Daenerys.

00:12:18.929 --> 00:12:23.480
Or maybe she’ll go off on her own as an
adventurer, and see what’s west of Westeros

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:29.110
. She could sail into the sunset like Frodo
in Lord of the Rings – a sad farewell to

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:33.480
a hero who was never quite whole after what
they’d been through.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.019
Or maybe Arya will only find peace in death.

00:12:37.019 --> 00:12:42.199
Her whole story is soaked in blood and loss
and trauma.

00:12:42.199 --> 00:12:47.459
Maybe when winter comes, the lone wolf will
die alone.

00:12:47.459 --> 00:12:53.679
In the Game of Thrones books, Arya is warg
like Bran – she can enter the mind of Nymeria.

00:12:53.679 --> 00:12:59.240
So there are cool theories about Arya dying
but living on in her wolf, running with her

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:00.240
pack.

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:03.069
The books have a lot more magic and prophecy
than the show.

00:13:03.069 --> 00:13:06.839
Everything's darker and deeper and more complex.

00:13:06.839 --> 00:13:10.970
If you wanna check out the books, you can
get one on audiobook for free today by signing

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.790
up for a trial at audible.com/asx.

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:18.519
Audible has the whole Game of Thrones series,
including the worldbook, short stories, and

00:13:18.519 --> 00:13:21.069
the new history book, Fire and Blood.

00:13:21.069 --> 00:13:25.649
Members can choose a free book each month,
and if you cancel, you keep the books.

00:13:25.649 --> 00:13:30.870
You can listen to audiobooks while you drive,
or gym, or while you cross the Narrow Sea.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:31.980
Thanks for watching.

